WEBVTT

00:00:25.450 --> 00:00:27.260
What's wrong, Kanami?

00:00:27.260 --> 00:00:31.750
I never thought I'd be coming 
back to where I met everyone.

00:00:32.860 --> 00:00:34.240
That makes sense.

00:00:34.240 --> 00:00:36.720
I never thought I'd be able to come back.

00:00:36.720 --> 00:00:38.760
It's too early to be getting lost in emotion.

00:00:38.760 --> 00:00:40.820
Saaya is right.

00:00:40.820 --> 00:00:45.170
The Storm Armor's running time is
 thirty minutes even with the spare battery.

00:00:45.170 --> 00:00:47.670
We have to defeat the great 
aradama in that time.

00:00:47.670 --> 00:00:50.290
Time is not on our side.

00:00:52.190 --> 00:00:53.850
That way, Nene?

00:00:53.850 --> 00:00:55.610
There's a reaction here, too.

00:00:55.610 --> 00:00:58.860
It's definitely in that direction.

00:00:59.360 --> 00:01:02.450
The shrine is that way.

00:01:02.450 --> 00:01:03.520
Shrine?

00:01:03.520 --> 00:01:05.700
It's the deepest part of the 
Origami family residence.

00:01:05.700 --> 00:01:09.220
Only the head of the family 
is allowed to enter there.

00:01:09.220 --> 00:01:11.750
That means the great aradama should be...

00:01:15.740 --> 00:01:17.690
Watch over me, Mother.

00:01:23.590 --> 00:01:24.840
That girl!

00:01:25.190 --> 00:01:26.860
Let's see...

00:01:29.390 --> 00:01:31.020
I choose you!

00:01:31.830 --> 00:01:32.980
Kanami!

00:01:36.560 --> 00:01:38.020
You're with the elite guard!

00:01:39.430 --> 00:01:40.670
Wonderful.

00:01:40.670 --> 00:01:44.350
Going up against you will be perfect.

00:01:53.160 --> 00:02:03.470
<b>Katana Maidens</b>

00:03:17.710 --> 00:03:23.130
<b>Episode 11  Gleam of Moonlight</b>

00:03:22.710 --> 00:03:25.300
Tsubakuro Yume has engaged the intruders.

00:03:25.300 --> 00:03:27.880
Combat is currently ongoing 
inside the main shrine.

00:03:30.080 --> 00:03:32.480
We're going, too, Suzuka.

00:03:32.480 --> 00:03:35.270
These girls are never 
really boring, are they?

00:03:46.410 --> 00:03:47.920
I knew it!

00:03:47.920 --> 00:03:50.610
I thought it might be true.

00:03:50.610 --> 00:03:54.240
You're definitely stronger than anyone else.

00:03:55.370 --> 00:03:58.610
That's why, if I defeat you, I'll...

00:04:01.130 --> 00:04:04.300
<i>Such amazing drive! How is she like this?</i>

00:04:07.640 --> 00:04:08.420
Why, you!

00:04:08.420 --> 00:04:12.000
<i>So strong. This is the peak 
of the Tennen Rishin style!</i>

00:04:12.000 --> 00:04:13.890
<i>I can do it, too!</i>

00:04:17.950 --> 00:04:21.230
Not yet, lady.

00:04:21.680 --> 00:04:23.860
<i>Is this girl in some kind of hurry?</i>

00:04:26.460 --> 00:04:28.070
This is fun, huh?

00:04:29.240 --> 00:04:30.320
Yeah.

00:04:35.330 --> 00:04:36.580
I'm cutting in!

00:04:36.580 --> 00:04:38.080
Dynamic!

00:04:40.700 --> 00:04:41.870
Let's go, Kanami!

00:04:41.870 --> 00:04:42.960
W-Wait, Hiyori-chan!

00:04:43.480 --> 00:04:44.770
Wait, Mai-chan!

00:04:44.770 --> 00:04:46.050
I wasn't finished fighting that girl!

00:04:46.050 --> 00:04:47.460
Just come on!

00:04:47.460 --> 00:04:48.620
Damn you!

00:04:50.420 --> 00:04:54.300
I almost had her! Why did you butt in?!

00:04:54.300 --> 00:04:57.910
It was worth it just to see
 the look on your face.

00:04:57.910 --> 00:05:02.650
We owe you quite a lot for 
our wounded Mokusa friends.

00:05:02.650 --> 00:05:07.010
So what? It's their fault for being so weak!

00:05:07.010 --> 00:05:08.110
I know that

00:05:08.110 --> 00:05:12.110
you two are being left 
behind because you're weak!

00:05:12.110 --> 00:05:15.250
Unlike that lady with Chidori,

00:05:15.250 --> 00:05:19.120
you two could only hold me
 back by working together.

00:05:19.120 --> 00:05:22.120
That's true, though it is frustrating.

00:05:22.120 --> 00:05:24.210
It is good that we have someone in command

00:05:24.210 --> 00:05:28.090
who can calmly assess the situation 
and make the best decision.

00:05:28.090 --> 00:05:29.570
So what?!

00:05:29.570 --> 00:05:32.800
Whatever! I'll take care of you 
two quickly, then catch up to her!

00:05:36.220 --> 00:05:38.690
I was a beat too late.

00:05:38.690 --> 00:05:42.350
We'll be sure to amuse you a bit,
 so please don't worry.

00:05:43.080 --> 00:05:45.850
<i>I don't have time for this!</i>

00:05:51.240 --> 00:05:52.430
We don't...

00:05:53.470 --> 00:05:54.860
What's the matter?

00:05:55.590 --> 00:05:57.760
We don't have time for this.

00:05:58.460 --> 00:05:59.870
Mai-chan?

00:05:59.870 --> 00:06:04.400
Our strongest members are 
definitely you and Hiyori-chan.

00:06:04.940 --> 00:06:09.440
In the worst case, you two have 
to get to the great aradama.

00:06:10.130 --> 00:06:14.560
It would be difficult for any one 
of us to hold that girl back.

00:06:15.130 --> 00:06:17.090
Two might do it,

00:06:17.090 --> 00:06:23.250
so that's why I decided on the best 
two-person team of Kaoru-chan and Ellen-chan.

00:06:24.410 --> 00:06:27.200
That's why... That's why I...

00:06:31.880 --> 00:06:34.560
I'm sorry! It's all right!

00:06:34.560 --> 00:06:37.870
I won't lose myself and forget 
what's important again.

00:06:38.350 --> 00:06:39.680
Kanami-chan...

00:06:41.660 --> 00:06:43.980
I'm so glad you're here, Mai-chan!

00:06:47.690 --> 00:06:49.670
Me, too. I'll obey you.

00:06:50.030 --> 00:06:52.220
Sayaka-chan, Hiyori-chan...

00:06:52.840 --> 00:06:53.630
Okay.

00:06:56.220 --> 00:06:56.900
Mai!

00:06:56.900 --> 00:06:57.840
Damn it!

00:06:58.550 --> 00:06:59.440
Mai!

00:06:59.800 --> 00:07:03.310
Third member of the elite 
guard, Satsuki Yomi!

00:07:03.310 --> 00:07:04.290
Hiyori-chan!

00:07:04.290 --> 00:07:05.930
Damn it, we're surrounded.

00:07:05.930 --> 00:07:06.940
Myougan...

00:07:06.940 --> 00:07:09.700
Left front, charge all together!

00:07:09.700 --> 00:07:10.470
Okay!

00:07:09.700 --> 00:07:10.470
Right!

00:07:16.030 --> 00:07:17.320
Mai-chan?!

00:07:17.320 --> 00:07:20.030
This is the best way now! Go!

00:07:22.080 --> 00:07:22.910
But...

00:07:22.910 --> 00:07:23.930
It's all right.

00:07:25.790 --> 00:07:27.600
I'll protect Mai.

00:07:27.600 --> 00:07:28.920
Sayaka-chan...

00:07:28.920 --> 00:07:30.190
Kanami!

00:07:31.350 --> 00:07:33.460
You two catch up as soon as you can.

00:07:33.460 --> 00:07:35.260
We'll go on ahead and wait.

00:07:35.660 --> 00:07:36.380
Okay!

00:07:38.580 --> 00:07:40.460
Mai, are you angry?

00:07:41.080 --> 00:07:41.990
Yes.

00:07:41.990 --> 00:07:44.430
I'm mad at the girl who wouldn't 
listen to my instructions.

00:07:46.060 --> 00:07:50.440
That's why I'm going to make you eat 
all my new cookies as punishment.

00:07:50.440 --> 00:07:51.700
Leave it to me.

00:07:54.320 --> 00:07:57.360
Why are you...?

00:08:03.830 --> 00:08:07.120
Hello, there. We haven't seen you since Izu.

00:08:07.120 --> 00:08:09.120
We knew you'd come.

00:08:09.120 --> 00:08:10.110
Kanami.

00:08:10.110 --> 00:08:10.920
Right.

00:08:10.920 --> 00:08:12.920
Now, where were we?

00:08:12.920 --> 00:08:15.380
It's kill or be killed.

00:08:15.380 --> 00:08:16.460
Her eyes...!

00:08:16.740 --> 00:08:20.050
That sinister gleam... you <i>are</i> using noro!

00:08:20.460 --> 00:08:24.410
So you'll protect Origami Yukari even 
if it means becoming half-aradama?

00:08:24.410 --> 00:08:26.720
Justice without power is powerless.

00:08:26.720 --> 00:08:29.310
You cannot protect anything without power.

00:08:29.310 --> 00:08:34.790
And there is also a happiness that 
is brought about by being powerful.

00:08:34.790 --> 00:08:40.950
I don't care at all if a god 
or a demon gives me that power.

00:08:51.870 --> 00:08:53.380
Sayaka!

00:08:53.910 --> 00:08:58.090
You were forced to play along with Origami
 Akane's ridiculous little performance,

00:08:58.630 --> 00:09:01.630
but I'm so glad you managed to make it back.

00:09:01.630 --> 00:09:03.040
Sayaka...

00:09:03.040 --> 00:09:04.640
I found you.

00:09:04.640 --> 00:09:09.140
You're finally ready to accept 
Yukari-sama's powers, aren't you?

00:09:09.140 --> 00:09:13.400
In light of that, I will forgive 
all of your recent selfishness.

00:09:15.210 --> 00:09:16.710
I will not hand over Sayaka-chan.

00:09:16.710 --> 00:09:18.540
What is the matter, Sayaka?

00:09:19.110 --> 00:09:21.600
There is nothing to be afraid of.

00:09:21.600 --> 00:09:25.950
You won't turn out like this failure,

00:09:25.950 --> 00:09:28.290
so don't worry.

00:09:30.540 --> 00:09:33.140
Now, Sayaka, come along.

00:09:33.140 --> 00:09:38.960
Become a Toji—no, an okatana 
who does Yukari-sama's bidding.

00:09:38.960 --> 00:09:40.670
What once was in my hand

00:09:40.670 --> 00:09:45.090
is now in yours, like the Myouhou Muramasa.

00:09:45.560 --> 00:09:49.680
That is what a tool should be.

00:10:18.820 --> 00:10:19.750
Damn it!

00:10:22.590 --> 00:10:24.130
What is this?

00:10:27.550 --> 00:10:30.390
Three, two, one!

00:10:30.390 --> 00:10:32.520
Zero!

00:10:32.520 --> 00:10:33.270
No way!

00:10:33.270 --> 00:10:34.140
Yes way.

00:10:43.490 --> 00:10:45.200
Don't go...

00:10:45.200 --> 00:10:47.110
...underestimating us too much.

00:10:47.110 --> 00:10:49.260
Damn... you!

00:10:55.100 --> 00:10:57.130
Damn you!

00:10:59.540 --> 00:11:02.550
Damn you!

00:11:04.730 --> 00:11:06.950
Even though you're so weak...

00:11:06.950 --> 00:11:09.440
You, too! Don't come out!

00:11:09.440 --> 00:11:11.740
I will not use aradama power!

00:11:39.580 --> 00:11:44.440
Damn it... That won't work!

00:11:44.740 --> 00:11:49.430
You think I'll fall for that?

00:12:00.060 --> 00:12:05.230
You know I'm perfectly willing to cut you 
down without your utsushi, don't you,

00:12:05.230 --> 00:12:06.820
Juujou Hiyori?

00:12:12.450 --> 00:12:13.240
Hiyori-chan!

00:12:13.240 --> 00:12:14.620
Think again!

00:12:19.330 --> 00:12:21.060
The first point is mine.

00:12:21.060 --> 00:12:24.670
That is my thanks to you for 
outmaneuvering me the other day.

00:12:26.350 --> 00:12:28.180
You're strong, but...

00:12:28.180 --> 00:12:30.720
We cannot be stopped here.

00:12:31.180 --> 00:12:32.890
Everyone sent us off...

00:12:32.890 --> 00:12:34.930
...for that reason!

00:12:37.950 --> 00:12:39.480
Please stop.

00:12:39.480 --> 00:12:40.910
What?

00:12:41.650 --> 00:12:44.050
Please stop doing horrible things.

00:12:44.050 --> 00:12:45.570
Sayaka-chan...

00:12:45.570 --> 00:12:49.010
If you don't, I will have to...

00:12:49.010 --> 00:12:52.700
Kill? Me? You will?

00:12:57.660 --> 00:12:59.540
Do not speak so presumptuously!

00:12:59.540 --> 00:13:02.240
You should just be silent and follow orders!

00:13:02.240 --> 00:13:05.290
You need to stop talking, President Takatsu.

00:13:06.550 --> 00:13:11.800
I cannot approve of someone like you, 
who can only treat people as things.

00:13:11.800 --> 00:13:16.340
I will never let you, nor Origami Yukari,

00:13:16.340 --> 00:13:18.930
do what you want with Sayaka-chan.

00:13:18.930 --> 00:13:20.510
Utter nonsense.

00:13:20.510 --> 00:13:25.380
All those who are involved with okatana 
are there for Yukari-sama's sake.

00:13:25.380 --> 00:13:28.940
Even though there are failures like this.

00:13:28.940 --> 00:13:29.940
What?!

00:13:32.260 --> 00:13:35.060
You really are strange.

00:13:35.060 --> 00:13:38.270
What have you been thinking 
ever since you were chosen

00:13:38.270 --> 00:13:40.660
as an experimental subject on a whim?

00:13:40.660 --> 00:13:42.830
You don't know anything!

00:13:46.070 --> 00:13:47.210
Stand up.

00:13:51.080 --> 00:13:54.740
What's the matter? Going to
 say something resentful?

00:13:54.740 --> 00:13:56.720
I will capture the traitors.

00:13:56.720 --> 00:13:59.150
That is the duty of the elite guard.

00:14:00.850 --> 00:14:03.980
<i>Satsuki-san, why are you going this far?</i>

00:14:10.630 --> 00:14:11.460
Mai!

00:14:11.460 --> 00:14:13.650
Right. Here we go, Sayaka-chan.

00:14:13.650 --> 00:14:15.600
Don't kill Sayaka.

00:14:22.380 --> 00:14:23.410
Kaoru!

00:14:26.710 --> 00:14:27.350
Kaoru!

00:14:34.520 --> 00:14:36.590
Everyone keeps wasting my time...

00:14:37.470 --> 00:14:40.930
Even though you're so...

00:14:45.980 --> 00:14:50.350
Everyone keeps getting in my way!

00:15:03.500 --> 00:15:05.160
I have to hurry.

00:15:12.550 --> 00:15:15.170
I don't have any more time.

00:15:15.660 --> 00:15:20.100
I have to keep fighting more and more.

00:15:34.230 --> 00:15:37.450
I have to hurry.

00:15:43.110 --> 00:15:44.620
Quit scurrying around!

00:15:48.370 --> 00:15:49.580
There!

00:15:49.580 --> 00:15:50.380
Damn—

00:15:51.820 --> 00:15:53.040
<i>She left an opening on purpose?</i>

00:15:55.510 --> 00:15:58.620
I'll corner you this way.

00:16:00.490 --> 00:16:01.510
You're already...

00:16:01.920 --> 00:16:06.490
You're already so strong.
Why do you accept the aradama?

00:16:08.090 --> 00:16:12.650
I have never once thought 
of myself as strong.

00:16:14.100 --> 00:16:16.570
Those I sought after were always far away.

00:16:17.570 --> 00:16:20.450
The summit I look up to is incredibly high.

00:16:20.700 --> 00:16:23.050
I will obtain the power 
that can make me equal.

00:16:23.530 --> 00:16:26.480
I will do whatever it takes
 to accomplish that.

00:16:26.990 --> 00:16:28.750
Isn't it the same for you?

00:16:31.750 --> 00:16:34.250
This is how it ends.

00:16:40.130 --> 00:16:42.580
Your friend is in trouble.

00:16:42.580 --> 00:16:44.550
Are you not going to save her today?

00:16:44.550 --> 00:16:46.720
Hiyori-chan is strong!

00:16:46.720 --> 00:16:47.890
Oh, is that right?

00:16:53.800 --> 00:16:54.690
<i>You're mine!</i>

00:16:57.030 --> 00:16:58.440
She deflected my attack?!

00:17:06.790 --> 00:17:10.350
You may be right.

00:17:10.790 --> 00:17:15.420
To achieve my objective, I will 
use whatever is necessary

00:17:15.420 --> 00:17:18.670
to beat you here and now!

00:17:40.390 --> 00:17:41.570
Hiyori-chan!

00:17:43.770 --> 00:17:44.700
Let's go.

00:17:46.330 --> 00:17:47.130
Right.

00:18:09.130 --> 00:18:10.370
Incredible!

00:18:10.370 --> 00:18:12.160
She has been recognized by the okatana!

00:18:12.160 --> 00:18:13.950
At such a young age!

00:18:27.660 --> 00:18:29.940
She defeated that many Toji by herself?

00:18:29.940 --> 00:18:31.410
She's certainly a prodigy!

00:18:40.670 --> 00:18:42.340
<b>Entrance Ceremony</b>

00:19:08.650 --> 00:19:10.490
It hurts so much.

00:19:10.900 --> 00:19:15.570
Papa, Mama, help me...

00:19:25.180 --> 00:19:27.950
Where is her family?

00:19:27.950 --> 00:19:30.030
None of them have ever come this whole time.

00:19:45.000 --> 00:19:46.440
Make a choice.

00:19:46.880 --> 00:19:51.200
Will you die in obscurity like this 
and vanish from everyone's memory?

00:19:51.700 --> 00:19:55.200
Or will you shine brightly for a 
moment and sear that brightness

00:19:55.510 --> 00:19:58.220
into the memories of all those 
who have forsaken you?

00:20:22.830 --> 00:20:25.340
I guess this is it.

00:20:25.940 --> 00:20:28.810
Even though it's still not enough.

00:20:29.950 --> 00:20:34.490
I wanted to sear the memory of 
my greatness into everyone more.

00:20:36.190 --> 00:20:38.650
I don't need anything else.

00:20:40.040 --> 00:20:45.340
As long as they remember me,
 that'll be enough.

00:21:04.480 --> 00:21:06.390
The shrine is in here!

00:21:06.390 --> 00:21:07.980
She's in there.

00:21:27.530 --> 00:21:29.380
The atmosphere has changed?

00:21:29.380 --> 00:21:31.620
Yes, this is probably—

00:21:39.190 --> 00:21:43.580
So you've returned, hatchlings.

00:21:47.480 --> 00:21:49.110
This feeling...

00:21:49.110 --> 00:21:51.910
Origami Yukari... No!

00:21:51.910 --> 00:21:53.140
Hiyori-chan!

00:21:53.140 --> 00:21:54.110
Right!

00:21:55.450 --> 00:21:57.620
So have you left the nest,

00:21:57.620 --> 00:22:00.370
or are you still naïve little birds?

00:22:00.370 --> 00:22:04.000
Prove yourselves with the swords you hold.

00:23:34.840 --> 00:23:39.840
<b>Next Episode  A Single Sword</b>
